}
static GDEvent *MatchingShot(GDEngine *e){for(NSInteger launcher=0;launcher<3;launcher++){[e selectLauncher:launcher];CGPoint origin=[e launcherPoint:launcher];for(NSInteger d=-73;d<=73;d++){CGFloat angle=d*M_PI/180;GDShot *shot=[e previewToward:CGPointMake(origin.x+sin(angle)*700,origin.y-cos(angle)*700)];if(shot.expectedMatches.count>=3&&[e beginShot:shot])return [e resolveShot];}}return nil;}
static void Boundaries(void){
